Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix: rename variant fields that collide with sibling
 variant records

Upstream: https://github.com/NordSecurity/uniffi-bindgen-cs/pull/190 (open), cherry-picked.
Needed for variants such as Event::Episodes { episodes }.

Signed-off-by: Jack Lavigne <jacklavigne00@gmail.com>
